OL,5,G1900 Classical Mixtape
OL,6,     FTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,7,     Fsoundscape of classical
OL,8,     Ffavourites, including music by
OL,9,     FHandel, Imogen Holst and Schubert.
OL,10,G1930 Friday Night is Music Night
OL,11,     FThe Ulster Orchestra performs
OL,12,     Fmusic by Harty, Bruch, Grace
OL,13,     FWilliams and Arnold to mark its
OL,14,     F60th birthday.
OL,15,G2145 The Essay: Symphony of the Wild
OL,16,     FMusic is thought to be a
OL,17,     Fphenomenon unique to humans. But
OL,18,     Fdoes it echo deeper into the story
OL,19,     Fof life on earth? Ben Garrod
OL,20,     Fexplores expressions of music in
OL,21,     Four early ancestors.
